{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D metroidvania with retro aesthetic.  As master peacock, delve into a mysterious, dream-like world with non-linear exploration and progression, stylish and challenging fights with a powerful halberd, tricky parkour and puzzles. Collect shadows, unleash darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-poly visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep combat and movement systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interconnected world </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming and parkour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends parts of metroidvanias, character action games, souls-likes and action-adventures with some unique takes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576560?t=1773993124","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576560?t=1773993124","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576560/2b12f62cea3fc2b272594d0c17d1b7da6bc026d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773993124","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576560/2b12f62cea3fc2b272594d0c17d1b7da6bc026d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773993124","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The games features frequent fantasy fig